---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import LegalPolicySidebar from '../components/LegalPolicySidebar.astro';
import '../styles/pages/legal-document.css';
import '../styles/pages/legal-document-overrides.css';
---
<!-- tailwind.css is loaded by SiteLayout. -->
<SiteLayout title="Educational Content Disclaimer | ZKTeco WFM" description="Important limitations that apply to ZKTeco WFM thought leadership, HR/payroll/compliance discussions, examples and product-related educational content.">
  <section class="zk-document-hero"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-eyebrow">Legal &amp; Privacy</div><h1>Educational Content &amp; Product-Capability Disclaimer</h1><p>Important limitations that apply to ZKTeco WFM thought leadership, HR/payroll/compliance discussions,<br />examples and product-related educational content.</p></div></section>
  <section class="zk-document"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-document-layout"><LegalPolicySidebar current="educational-disclaimer"><nav class="zk-policy-toc" aria-label="Document sections"><h2>In this disclaimer</h2><ol><li><a href="#general-educational-purpose">General Educational Purpose</a></li><li><a href="#no-professional-advice">No Legal, HR, Payroll, Compliance or Policy Advice</a></li><li><a href="#no-product-capability-promise">No Product-Capability Promise</a></li><li><a href="#requirements-are-evaluated">Requirements Are Evaluated</a></li><li><a href="#no-guarantee">No Guarantee of Compliance or Business Outcome</a></li><li><a href="#current-information">Current Information</a></li></ol></nav></LegalPolicySidebar><article class="zk-document-copy" aria-label="Educational Content Disclaimer"><h2 id="general-educational-purpose">General Educational Purpose</h2><p>ZKTeco WFM publishes articles, guides, website content, webinars, presentations and other materials to share general information, technology perspectives and industry education. This content is not intended to replace professional advice tailored to a specific organization.</p><h2 id="no-professional-advice">No Legal, HR, Payroll, Compliance or Policy Advice</h2><p>Nothing on this website should be considered legal, tax, accounting, employment, HR, payroll, labor, regulatory, compliance, privacy, cybersecurity, information-security, insurance or policy advice. Laws, regulations, collective-bargaining obligations, employment practices and internal policies vary by jurisdiction and organization and may change over time.</p><p>Organizations should consult their own qualified legal counsel, HR and payroll professionals, tax advisers, compliance teams, security/privacy professionals and other appropriate subject-matter experts before adopting or changing policies, configurations, controls or business practices.</p><h2 id="no-product-capability-promise">No Product-Capability Promise</h2><p>Examples of workflows, controls, data elements, integrations, authentication methods, compliance concepts or operating models are provided to explain industry considerations. They do not represent that every capability is standard, currently available in every ZKTeco WFM product, included in every release, supported in every geography or appropriate for every customer.</p><h2 id="requirements-are-evaluated">Requirements Are Evaluated</h2><p>ZKTeco WFM works with customers and software partners to understand business and technical requirements and, where appropriate, evaluate the available supported configuration, integration approach, existing product capability, reusable product enhancement or customer-specific solution. Feasibility, scope, timing, pricing and contractual commitments are determined through the applicable evaluation and agreement process.</p><h2 id="no-guarantee">No Guarantee of Compliance or Business Outcome</h2><p>Technology can support an organization’s processes and controls, but ZKTeco WFM does not guarantee that use of any product, feature, workflow or configuration will make an organization legally compliant, prevent all errors, eliminate all risk, or achieve a particular HR, payroll, legal, financial, security or operational outcome.</p><h2 id="current-information">Current Information</h2><p>Technology, product capabilities, standards and laws change. Readers should verify current information with the appropriate ZKTeco WFM team and their own advisers before making decisions.</p></article></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>